* opposite transfers, unique one-momentum parametrization of each pair fiber,
  independence of the order of its two electrons, and Hermitian symmetry;
* the full finite interaction and its symmetric kinetic-plus-potential Hamiltonian;
* the physical prefactor 1/(pi*L)=4*pi/(L^3*(2*pi/L)^2).

The nuclear H1 constant is eta * lambda_zeta * B.  B is the previously proved
