/-!
## Continuum spectral identification and passage to the cubic limit

This section uses a genuine continuum operator on a specified form domain.  The
Galerkin bridge identifies its quadratic form with the actual signed molecular
matrices, its exchange sector, and its cubic subspaces.  These are background
spectral identifications, not new Coulomb estimates.  In particular, the limit
energy belongs to the continuum eigenpair below; it is not an arbitrary finite
matrix energy with a different name.
-/

