finite-dimensional trial subspace, whether or not that subspace is invariant. -/
theorem exists_ritz_minimum_on_submodule
    {V : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup V] [InnerProductSpace ℂ V]
    [FiniteDimensional ℂ V] (H : V →ₗ[ℂ] V) (hH : H.IsSymmetric)
    (S : Submodule ℂ V) (hNonzero : ∃ u : V, u ∈ S ∧ u ≠ 0) :
    ∃ E : ℝ, (∀ v : V, v ∈ S → E * ‖v‖ ^ 2 ≤ (inner ℂ v (H v)).re) ∧
