/-!
# Identifying the completed potential from its proved Fourier coefficients

The lemmas here separate a finite coefficient calculation from the already
proved extension to H2. The later Coulomb specialization supplies both
coefficient identities and the constructed Hamiltonian's core identity as
proved facts; neither is an added physical assumption.
-/

namespace PlaneWaveCertificate

