# Dynamics: the finite-dimensional propagator

The propagator `e^{-iTt}` of a symmetric operator on a finite-dimensional complex inner product
space (the Galerkin propagator `e^{-iH_N t}`), from Mathlib's eigenvector basis and the diagonal
unitary group of `DevU1`.
