/-!
# Dynamics: the observable error of `thm:dyn`

Assembly of `eq:dyn-main` for a periodic Coulomb system, in Fourier coordinates: for
`ψ₀ = S u₀ ∈ D(H²)`, the observable `O = χ(x_a)` (the convolution `convOp a χ̂` with a real `χ`),
and the Galerkin state `ψ_N(t) = e^{-iH_N t} P ψ₀` of the cube of radius `n` (`K = g n`),
`|⟪ψ(t), O ψ(t)⟫ - ⟪ψ_N(t), O ψ_N(t)⟫|` is bounded by an explicit expression which is
`O(K^{-5} + t K^{-3})` plus `O(K^{-5/2})` times the tail `Σ_{g|ν| > K/2} |χ̂(ν)|`.
