/-!
# Dynamics: the normalised Galerkin state (`cor:norm`)

For `‖ψ₀‖ = 1` and `|χ| ≤ 1`, replacing the Galerkin state `ψ_N(t) = e^{-iH_N t} P ψ₀` by the
normalised `ψ_N(t)/‖P ψ₀‖` changes the expectation of `χ(x_a)` by at most
`1 - ‖P ψ₀‖² = ‖(1 - P) ψ₀‖²`, and `‖(1 - P) ψ₀‖ ≤ δ₁ K^{-5/2}`; so `eq:dyn-main` holds for the
normalised Galerkin trajectory with an extra `δ₁² K^{-5}`.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false

open scoped InnerProductSpace ComplexConjugate lp ENNReal Topology
open Filter Set MeasureTheory

namespace PlaneWaveDynamics

open PlaneWaveCertificate

