      (2 * (2 * (2 * ‖h₀‖ + 2 * relB sys L molecularCanonicalUnitHardyConstant * ‖ψ₀‖) +
        2 * relB sys L molecularCanonicalUnitHardyConstant * ‖ψ₀‖) +
